# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintainted in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Mac OS X
**/.DS_Store

# Data files
C-MAPSS/
N-CMAPSS/
*.h5
*.npy
*.npz
*.txt

# --- Project-specific (PRC-DC2026, added by Task 01) ---
# The agent_skills template above covers only generic patterns. These paths are
# required by Task 01 acceptance criteria (git/secret hygiene) and are NOT covered
# by the template. Template body preserved byte-for-byte above; only additions below.
data/
models/
# Ignore submission payloads but track the markdown log: a bare `submissions/`
# rule excludes the directory, which makes `!submissions/*.md` ineffective.
submissions/*
!submissions/*.md
# Final submission archive (Task 4.2): a bare negation of files inside an
# ignored directory is ineffective, so re-include `final/` first, then the
# parquet inside it, to keep the final payload tracked.
!submissions/final/
!submissions/final/*.parquet
resources/credentials.json
# CatBoost training artifacts (Task 3.3)
catboost_info/
# Tuning runtime artifacts (Task 3.3)
logs/
# Public-release staging area (Task 4.3) — a separate repo, built and pushed
# from here; never part of the working tree's history.
dist/
